# Candle Making (jeuno 22): Rouliette in Upper Jeuno (no script; default 30; no other quest or mission names her).
# A Candlelight Vigil accepted (GM): a Lanolin Cube while available (the available section has no trade handler:
# nothing), 36 (any option: begun), 36 again while accepted (the accepted section has no 36 finish: nothing), two cubes
# (not tradeMatches: nil), one cube (37: completed, the Holy Candle, Believer of Altana, fame +13 x3, the cube taken),
# then completed: her default 30, and a cube (no section: nothing).
# Not reachable: :60 complete false (a key item and a title: nothing can fail).
lists UpperJeuno/Rouliette/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Rouliette/onTrade UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/36 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/37
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-19.7,-1.5,12.6 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.ACandlelightVigil accepted
item LanolinCube x4
login
walk -20.2,-1.5,12.6
trade Rouliette LanolinCube x1          # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Rouliette                       # A Candlelight Vigil accepted: 36
finish option=1                         # begun (the finish reads no option)
trigger Rouliette                       # accepted: 36
finish                                  # the accepted section has no 36 finish: nothing
trade Rouliette LanolinCube x2          # two cubes: not tradeMatches, nil
trade Rouliette LanolinCube x1          # 37
finish                                  # completed: Holy Candle, Believer of Altana, fame +13 x3, the cube taken
trigger Rouliette                       # completed: no section; default 30
finish
trade Rouliette LanolinCube x1          # completed: no section, nothing
